# Vercel auto-detects any top-level api/ directory as Vercel
# Serverless Functions. Our api/ folder is the FastAPI app deployed
# separately on Render — it was never meant to run on Vercel, and
# without this, Vercel builds a Python environment from
# api/requirements.txt on every deploy for no reason (confirmed in a
# real build log: "Installing required dependencies from
# api/requirements.txt..." when only the static frontend should be
# built here).
api/
pipeline/